  "details": "Colors of Transparent avatars are too dark in the personal mirror with the world masked out. \n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Go into a well lit world\n\n2. Open the Personal mirror with the World Masked out (Set to 100% opacity makes it easiest to see)\n\n3. Use this test avatar, which uses Standard Transparent Shader (avtr_43515e02-3a4d-4fe0-94e0-a0f3f59195b7)\n\n4. The Color is much darker in the transparent mirror compared to in the world. It should look the same. \n\nSee attached screenshots for what the Mirror without World Mask and with World Mask look like. Expected Behaviour: They should not differ much.",
